  <name>Neomacs</name>
  <summary>Extensible, GPU-native text editor</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Neomacs is an extensible text editor built with a Rust-based virtual
      machine and a GPU-native rendering pipeline (wgpu/Vulkan). It runs
      Emacs Lisp for configuration and extensibility, with a modern rendering
      architecture that supports smooth animations, variable-height fonts, and
      hardware-accelerated display.
    </p>
  </description>
